<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">As your personal admission counselor at Arizona State University, I am here to help you through the admission process, and I noticed your application is still incomplete.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you haven't already done so, please activate your <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> page so you can review your application status and take care of any <b>Priority Tasks</b> needed to complete your application.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Currently, you are missing the following item to complete your application and receive an admission decision:</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ff0000"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&lt;&lt;CHOOSE ONE BULLET POINT OPTION FROM BELOW&gt;&gt;</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><b>Pay your application fee. </b>You can submit your application fee online through <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> or by sending a check or money order to:&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div><font face="arial"><b>Admission Services</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div><font face="arial">P.O. Box 870112&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</font></div></blockquote><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><b>Send us your official transcripts.</b> Have your school send your official transcripts to:</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div><font face="arial"><b>Admission Services</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div><font face="arial">P.O. Box 870112&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</font></div></blockquote><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><b>Pay your application fee</b> and <b>send us your official transcripts</b>. You can submit your application fee online through <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> or by sending a check or money order to Admission Services. Have your school send your official transcripts to Admission Services to the address below.</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div><font face="arial"><b>Admission Services</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div><font face="arial">P.O. Box 870112&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</font></div></blockquote><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions about this process, or if there is anything I can do to help, please let me know.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
